Ghairat e Mustafa (saww) Bai Rida Aa Gai<br>
Bint e Sher e Khuda (as) Bai Rida Aa Gai<br>
<br>
Mazloom e Karbala (as) Ki Azadar Aa Gai<br>
Zainab (sa) Barehna Sar Jo Bazaar Aa Gai<br>
<br>
Talwar Kay Bagair Larungi Main Aesi Jang<br>
Khutbay Parhungi Aesay Kay Dushman Bhi Hongain Tang<br>
Daikho Hussain (as) Tum Bhi Hamaray Jihad Ko<br>
Zainab (sa) Hai Aj Ban Kay Alamdar Aa Gai<br>
<br>
Zainab (sa) Nay Zindagi Main Na Daikhi Koi Kushi<br>
Roti Huwi Woh Sham Ki Rahon Main Mar Gai<br>
Tanha Lahad Main Bhai Ko Rone Kay Waste<br>
Sarkar Panjetan Ki Woh GhamKhaar Aa Gai<br>
<br>
Jis Dum Utha Yeh Shor Kay Pyase Ko Mar Lo<br>
Jaldi Karo Nabi (saww) Kay Nawasay Ko Mar Lo<br>
Sun Kar Yeh Shor Dhundti Tanha Hussain Ko <br>
Maqtal Main Bint e Haider e Karar (as) Aa Gai<br>
<br>
Chehlum Ko Karbala Main Jo Pohancha Tha Qafla<br>
Zainab (sa) Nay Keh Kay Nakai Say Khud Ko Giraya Tha<br>
Badle Chuka Kay Baba Kay Saray Mairay Hussain (as)<br>
Chehlum Mananay Apki Zawaar Aa Gai<br>
<br>
Mehshar Kay Roz Ayegi Jab Naib e Batool<br>
Tanweer Yeh Kahain Gay Khuda Say Mairay Rasool<br>
Zinda Rakhai Hain Jis Nay Irade Hussain (as) Kay<br>
Ya Rab Woh Mairay Dee'n Ki Madadgaar Aa gai